Anthropic accelerates

Anthropic filed for an initial public offering on the US stock market on Mo=
nday, ahead of what it slated to be one of the biggest debuts in financial =
history. The company withheld a valuation from its filing with US financial=
 regulators, but investors and analysts are valuing the
https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTN=
tZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEDoQXUf7qKBK4SndmHCaREcTBWx8Ki0bgwU-HFBT97qKgqxjj9O99OVo6I=
mZwNqMJrhql2OZ6xkAgEVAoXv25TreLnV08y29T9HY7UAMFyn4uWydNI1PxihiiJoEIr0s6elb_=
