b70b9b355efdf3486" style=3D"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decora=
tion:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;" width=3D"566" height=3D"a=
uto"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr>
<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The successful campaigning via WhatsApp be=
ars out a prediction that Meta CEO Mark Zuckerberg made in 2019: that the =
=E2=80=9Cdigital living room=E2=80=9D of private direct messaging and group=
 chats would eclipse the =E2=80=9Ctown square=E2=80=9D style of public soci=
al media feeds. Lula=E2=80=99s supporters gathered in channels full of frie=
ndly faces to participate together in on-the-ground canvassing. Janones was=
n=E2=80=99t posting to convert the general populace to his side. He was mot=
ivating the base with online communication to pursue IRL action. Members of=
 Lula=E2=80=99s army were explicitly instructed supporters to neither share=
 nor respond to posts from the opposition, displaying an understanding that=
 any engagement boosts algorithmic reach in public social media.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Lula won the Brazilian election by 5 milli=
on votes, securing an unprecedented fourth term. After Janones=E2=80=99s in=
novative use of WhatsApp, Lula=E2=80=99s accusations seem like politicking =
borne of desperation. Lula also plays into longstanding conflicts between B=
razil and tech giants like Meta. A decade ago, the country=E2=80=99s suprem=
e court suspended WhatsApp, the very app Lula rode to victory, in a fight o=
ver end-to-end encryption. The court has also ordered investigations into G=
oogle and Telegram executives. In 2024, a supreme court justice banned Elon=
 Musk=E2=80=99s X from the country after Musk refused to ban accounts threa=
tening democracy and froze the financial accounts of his satellite internet=
 company Starlink.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Having a common enemy helps to galvanize a=
 base of supporters. In Lula=E2=80=99s case, the enemy was an easy target: =
a foreign tech company accused of interfering in Brazil=E2=80=99s democracy=
, as did Jair Bolsonaro, Lula=E2=80=99s longtime foe. According to my colle=
ague <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLME=
mFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEB-ac_e6ZWOBuq0B2fiARjl1k_UFtPifkJc6DzJc-f=
7hmc7mkhIcWwmAKP2_1-kztTCsofb6359_Tfgn0prhUXdEWIPvPPt27he-BPTp3HzXIEcVEANJu=
PvVBCK1nVZutude-aeiXLDb2FF-mK8xsAbIWJ8QgYbIR3kmREVVAQNHnlbPl8S89EMLActLzlt7=
sjVttyxnThf3Ouxp8rh791VPBATGJ6BV-h7THU3g4bmdD0SDZCVfLij-MNq-PDznRM/4vf/SJ3J=
yLPxRPixYOWs4-ltyA/h38/h001._WEwU5h7KjY6Gu3cebBBa2mTxu4GnCLQaXo4mKWKiB8" st=
yle=3D"color: #0077B6;">Jonathan Watts</a>, among the most popular chants o=
f Lula supporters was =E2=80=9CHey Meta, vai tomar no cu!=E2=80=9D (Hey Met=
a, go take it up the arse!).</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Read more: </strong><a href=3D"htt=
